{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_EXPORT__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro value) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_EXPORT__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Returns non-zero (-1) when exporting symbols has been enabled with [[CompilerOptexport|-export]], or zero (0) otherwise.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptexport|Compiler Option: -export]]

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Intrinsic Defines"}}
